WEBVTT

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.840
That's right...

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:15.660
If not for Kyohei-sama, we all would've died.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:55.670
Kyohei-sama said he didn't remember

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:58.000
what happened next, but...

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.950
It's absorbing it...

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.950
<b>Episode 11</b>

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.950
<b>Hibino Kidnapped</b>

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:28.930
It ran out of ammo?

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:30.960
Kyohei!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.150
Hey!

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:14.580
Where's Kyohei?

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.890
In that moment,

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:36.650
Kyohei-sama became my one and only hero.

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:43.740
So when I heard he captured you,

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.410
I wasn't surprised at all.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.410
I was impressed!

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:53.040
I was more surprised when stupid little Utao 
took over as a Seki afterwards.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.630
It didn't make any sense!

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.190
Every single Kuga must be blind.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.020
And?

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:04.360
How did you end up working with Hirashiro?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:06.550
He doesn't matter.

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:10.720
As long as the Kuga and Hyuga fight,

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:15.100
Kyohei-sama and I can never 
be together in that village.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.580
You, Koushiro, Utao, and even Moyako

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:21.140
are coming to Tokyo and messing around!

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:30.740
Anyway,

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:33.750
I just want to know why I'm the only one

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.170
bound by all this old crap.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:38.470
What's wrong with getting rid of those stupid rules,

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.250
if that means Kyohei-sama and I can be together?

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.060
And I'll use anything and everything

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.130
I can to make that happen!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.130
What does "Kyohei-sama" think about this?

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.930
He's got a girlfriend.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.280
What did you say?

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:00.430
The girl with the boobs.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:03.850
The girl who was padding.

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:06.050
I didn't think it was possible...

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:10.050
What you're doing is pointless.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:13.660
Shut up.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.540
That girl...

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:28.800
Aren't you worried?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.480
Yeah.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:33.920
Kuga-kun never explains what's really important.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.480
What are you writing?

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.680
I don't understand what's happening anymore, so...

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:45.630
Let me see...

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.820
There's a lot of hard kanji.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.160
I'm impressed you know all this.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.330
I'm almost in middle school!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.830
<b>Final Goal: Capture Aki 
Private: Kirio 
Point: Kukuri</b>

00:05:57.050 --> 00:06:00.190
Since Mahiru-san arrived, everything's gotten messed up.

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.310
Let's go see him again.

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:09.780
You're the big sister, so you need to stay strong.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:10.970
That's how it works?

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.350
Isn't it?

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:19.480
Let's make him something to give to him.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.920
Something?

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.690
You know, like candy.

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:25.610
I'm back.

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.350
He's back.

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.690
Welcome back.

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:37.040
Hibino-san?

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:42.750
Um, will you tell me what you 
and Koushiro-san discussed?

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:52.390
You never tell me anything important!

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:57.930
<b>Hibino 
Back to a Rival (?)</b>

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.730
That's more or less what I told Koushiro about.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.750
Thank you for telling me.

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:12.610
I don't really remember what 
happened in the forest.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.970
That's no fair, Mahiru-chan!

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:19.500
I've never seen Kyohei acting cool like that!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.550
So, that's the problem?

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:27.580
Is Mahiru here on her family's orders?

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:34.770
Even if she's a Seki, sending a girl her age alone...

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:35.850
Isn't it strange?

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.400
If it bothers you,

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:40.350
go ask the Hyuga family head yourself.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:44.160
No, I shouldn't tell him about that fight yet.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:45.260
What?

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:46.950
Aren't you being overly cautious?

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.970
I don't have any proof,

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:51.350
but it's giving me a weird feeling in here.

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:55.210
Something else is going on.

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:57.510
Someone is behind this.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:01.270
Anyway, it never hurts to be careful.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:04.570
I shouldn't talk to him until I'm sure.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.670
Maybe you're cut out

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.750
to be the next family head, after all.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.320
Change your opinion of me?

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:11.610
Don't fall in love.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:12.890
Idiot.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.220
Man, I'm awesome.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:18.410
It's a perfect fit!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.100
Moyako!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.360
You're here?

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.980
Is that a problem?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.460
I've been fixing your Takemikazuchi.

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:31.140
Come on, boys that age shouldn't 
wander around in a towel.

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:32.830
Don't pull!

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.620
I mistook you for Utao!

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.240
Don't make mistakes like that!

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.050
You act just like her.

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:41.640
Stop it, pervert.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.660
What?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:46.270
Kids that age are vulnerable...

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:49.860
Especially to beautiful women.

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.380
Say it like you mean it!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.040
Now, then...

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:56.590
That's all the tuning-up for today.

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:58.290
I'm heading out.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:00.070
Tomorrow will be a busy day.

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:01.220
Going somewhere?

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:05.270
Shopping with Hibino in Shibuya!

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.300
Bye!

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:14.170
Did she just say something 
that sounded like a girl?

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.410
She is a girl.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.570
And that's really mean.

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:22.080
You're a girl, too.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:25.590
You should have gone shopping with them, too.

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:28.980
If I'm not around, they won't have 
to worry about where they go.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:31.520
You're really nice, in a strange way.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:35.940
<i>Actually, I just hate the crowds downtown.</i>

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:38.060
<i>Especially in Shibuya.</i>

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:45.870
Looks like these baked up well.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:50.040
They're all right.

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.610
Of course! I'm a big sister.

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.860
I'm going to give them to Kirio.

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.550
I bought too much.

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:05.630
So heavy.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:07.180
I didn't expect you to buy so much.

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:10.240
I feel kind of bad for bringing you.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:12.070
It's fine, it's fine.

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.450
I feel better.

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:14.220
Yeah?

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:17.070
But you must have spent a lot...

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:18.350
It's really okay.

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:21.600
In the village, there's nothing for me to spend it on.

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:23.390
<b>The type who immediately forgets about money spent.</b>

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:27.050
Actually, would you watch these for a second?

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.380
I've gotta pee.

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:30.150
Sure.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.950
I'm just not used to her way of talking.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:35.780
It feels weird.

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:41.370
But I'm glad she seemed to have fun today.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:46.160
<i>All I can do is hang out with her.</i>

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.570
You're coming with me.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:54.290
Hello there, Shiba Hibino.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.130
Mahiru-san?

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.390
I'm back, Hibino...

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.980
Hibino?

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.440
Moyako?

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:25.530
Hello?

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.590
Kyohei!

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:27.610
Hibino's...

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:39.390
Mahiru-san?

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.630
Welcome to my room.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:45.910
Actually, it's the first time I've been here.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:46.970
Where are we?

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:50.070
One of their hideouts,

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:51.320
I'm told.

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:53.400
I had them give it to me.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.020
Who?

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.500
It doesn't matter.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:03.040
The problem is that you're seducing Kyohei-sama!

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.330
I'm... What?

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:11.650
So, these are how you're doing it.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:13.560
What are these, anyway?

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:17.290
You're a whore, letting your boobs grow this big.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:23.140
Don't they say that girls with big boobs are idiots?

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:26.970
I can't imagine you being suitable for Kyohei-sama.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:30.140
What are you talking about?

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.050
You can't hide it from me!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:37.500
I know the terrible truth! 
You're dating Kyohei-sama!

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:39.510
That isn't true!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:41.530
Don't lie to me. It won't work.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:47.240
Listen, I'm the only one worthy of Kyohei-sama!

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:50.350
I, the Hyuga's strongest Seki.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:53.110
And Kyohei-sama, the Kuga's strongest Seki.

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:55.870
We're like a modern Romeo and Juliet.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:59.120
But that doesn't mean that we'll end up dead,

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.420
like in the story.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:07.640
Once we're married, a new era will begin, 
in that out-of-date village!

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.350
Together, the two of us

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.770
will destroy the village's old rules and rulers,

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:15.730
and create a new paradise.

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:22.020
So I won't let someone average

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:25.190
like you come between us!

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:26.160
Got it?

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:29.540
Kuga-kun is the strongest Seki...

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:31.660
Aki-san said the same thing.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.410
He controls Kukuri as though it were a mad god,

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:36.960
destroying anything in its path.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:42.680
He's a mighty warrior, beyond any other.

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.890
What's that look?

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:48.880
I wouldn't want anything that scary for him.

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:53.520
Don't you think he's happier this way?

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:57.200
What are you talking about?

00:13:57.200 --> 00:14:02.670
This is why I hate city-bred wimps!

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:03.580
Listen up!

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:06.250
This world is one of conquest!

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:09.100
Survival of the fittest is its law!

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:11.580
Nothing's really yours until you 
take it for yourself!

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:16.910
Don't look at me like that!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.690
What?

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:20.290
She kidnapped a civilian?

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.440
Shiba Hibino.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:27.460
The girl whose family Kuga Kyohei is staying with.

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:30.260
Even if they're related to the village, 
that's going too far.

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.800
Why didn't you stop her?

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.270
I couldn't!

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.510
Know what I mean?

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:37.630
If I had tried to stop her, 
she would've killed me!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.150
Aki must've put her up to this.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:43.520
That little brat.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:46.020
Shiba! Shiba!

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:46.920
One second.

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:48.360
Mahiru-sama is shouting.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:49.520
I'll have to call you back!

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:50.740
Hey...

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:53.750
What is it?

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:57.980
I'm going out. Watch the girl.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.080
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.710
But where are you going...

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:03.130
A date!

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:06.680
Mahiru-sama!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.380
Mahiru-sama?

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:11.180
What? Mahiru kidnapped her?

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.300
Are you certain?

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:16.340
You don't know for sure it was her.

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:19.940
Mahiru already saw Hibino-san with us.

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:22.570
That's true.

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.300
I'll look into it.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:26.470
If I find anything, I'll call you.

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.380
What happened with Mahiru-neesama?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:32.200
The girl with the big tits is missing.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.200
Yeah, Mahiru-neesama would do that.

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:41.480
Let's call the police.

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:42.740
Oji-san...

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:46.840
It's possible that someone else kidnapped her.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:50.590
So we should have the police look 
for her, before it's too late...

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.350
Kyohei-sama!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:01.730
Mahiru!

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:08.650
I'm glad to see you, Kyohei-sama.

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:15.890
What's wrong? You look mad.

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:19.970
I came to see you. Aren't you happy?

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:24.920
Mahiru, did you take Hibino-san?

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:28.590
Who cares about that stupid girl?

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.380
Answer me.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:33.340
I did.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.650
Everyone's worried.

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:38.850
Give her back immediately.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:43.190
Are you worried, too?

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:44.420
Of course!

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.270
Because she's your lover?

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:53.750
Listen, I don't know where you're getting this,

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:56.070
but Hibino-san and I aren't dating...

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:58.490
You're lying!

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:01.750
I heard it from Aki.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:02.500
Aki?

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.400
No! No!

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:07.860
Even if that was all lies,

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:10.250
who knows when you'll fall victim

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:13.630
to that witch and her wiles!

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:16.790
You and I have a bright future together,

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:19.420
so you need to forget about the past!

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:23.930
I must eliminate her now!

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.530
Mahiru-chan?

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:27.060
What do you want, kid?

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:29.760
I have a lot to say, actually...

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:34.570
First... First, get your feet off that box!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:37.950
What? You mean this garbage?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:42.240
You're the one who made it into garbage!

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:46.580
You're pretty quick to anger, kid.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.330
Get off.

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:50.790
No!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.800
Kyohei-sama...

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:01.560
Come back to the village with me.

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:04.760
I...

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.590
can't.

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:15.300
Idiot!

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.400
Mahiru!

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.210
Hey, don't run!

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.680
My cookies!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:32.650
Kyohei, you suck at negotiating.

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:35.310
I can't lie.

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:37.380
I guess not.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.990
Kyohei...

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:40.190
It's fine.

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:43.320
Mahiru isn't really the kind of girl who's violent.

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:44.950
You think so?

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:52.150
<i>But if someone other than Mahiru's involved, 
Hibino-san's in danger.</i>

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.150
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.950
You're...

00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:10.370
Don't worry.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.330
I'm told we're releasing you soon.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.180
By whom? Mahiru-san?

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:17.100
Who knows...

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:21.050
Then, someone's also controlling Mahiru-san.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.300
I'm surprised.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.590
Sometimes, being too smart is a liability.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.810
Don't worry.

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:29.330
I have my orders.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.120
I won't kill you.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.480
But you know...

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.360
You're Kyohei's girl, huh?

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:42.870
It'll be fun to see the look on his face.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.040
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:47.370
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:50.030
<i>What clues do I have?</i>

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:51.910
<i>Where do I start?</i>

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:53.860
What's wrong?

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:01.500
This time, you aren't an outsider.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:03.930
You're part of it, just like you wanted.

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:08.510
But you're not a Seki, 
so you don't have a kakashi.

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:12.290
You don't have anything.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.940
Can you protect what you care about?

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:19.940
Wouldn't you have looked cooler as an outsider?

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.330
Screw you, Aki!

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:27.860
Utao, can you follow Magatsuhi?

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:31.460
I'm a Seki.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:33.580
Let's go.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.620
She teleported.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:36.780
Can you do it?

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:39.500
We don't have a choice!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:42.700
Now what?

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.840
Karahari-san?

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:48.280
Yes? Hello?

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:50.990
Sorry, I'm really busy...

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.730
A Setagaya penthouse?

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:00.040
Is her information worth anything?

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:01.040
I don't know!

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:04.290
But I need every clue I can get!

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:10.080
Oji-san, I'll bring Hibino-san home, 
no matter what.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.790
Kyohei-kun...

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:13.460
Please do.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:15.000
Right!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:17.210
Let's go, Utao.

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:22.580
Take me, too!

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:24.010
What are you doing?

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:26.430
Shut up! I'm responsible, also!

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.800
Hey... You two, stay put.

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:35.940
Yelling won't help.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:40.690
The soundproofing in these penthouses 
is really good.

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:48.330
<i>Hibino-san...</i>

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:37.980
<b>Kamisama 
Dolls 
Corner</b>

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:37.980
<b>Special</b>

00:23:23.530 --> 00:23:26.970
You can only see Kamisama Dolls Corner 
on <i>Kamisama Dolls</i>.

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:28.670
Kukuri's spinning more than ever!

00:23:28.610 --> 00:23:30.130
<b>This Is a 
Kakashi's Power</b>

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:30.130
We'll cover more kakashi today.

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:30.950
Here we go!

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:31.680
<b>I don't like it.</b>

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:31.680
<b>It extends!</b>

00:23:30.950 --> 00:23:32.850
This is Mahiru-chan's Magatsuhi.

00:23:32.320 --> 00:23:33.220
<b>I don't like the wires...</b>

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:35.020
It has a barrier that stops enemy attacks.

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:34.760
<b>Really don't like it!</b>

00:23:35.020 --> 00:23:36.280
And here's the mysterious kakashi

00:23:35.410 --> 00:23:36.250
<b>Scary...</b>

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:38.410
that appeared in Karakami Village back then.

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:39.690
No one knows its power source or strength.

00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:40.950
It's mysterious!

00:23:40.950 --> 00:23:43.160
But it looks like it's the strongest!

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:44.220
Kukuri's scared, too.

00:23:44.220 --> 00:23:45.470
But that was long ago,

00:23:45.470 --> 00:23:46.750
so it doesn't matter, right?

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:49.900
<b>Next Episode: 
Out of Control</b>

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:47.520
Next time: Out of Control.

00:23:47.520 --> 00:23:49.900
If you don't watch, 
then beam-beam-beam-beam-beam!

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:54.520
